# game/chapters/01/ch_01_28.rpy:6
translate chinese ch01_28_Nap_4425f8f3:

    # n "As you enter your room, you feel your legs getting heavy, and you can practically hear your bed calling your name." with disText
    n "你进入你的房间后，你感到你的两腿一沉，你几乎可以听到你的床在呼唤你的名字。" with disText

# game/chapters/01/ch_01_28.rpy:8
translate chinese ch01_28_Nap_5a65eedc:

    # n "With a sliver of your unoccupied mind, you wonder why you've felt so tired ever since leaving the hospital." with disText
    n "带着一点空闲的思绪，你想知道为什么离开医院后你会觉得这么累。" with disText

# game/chapters/01/ch_01_28.rpy:10
translate chinese ch01_28_Nap_cb30f536:

    # n "You let yourself fall onto the soft mattress and feel the weight of the day lift from your shoulders..." with disText
    n "你瘫倒在床垫上，感觉身上的重担全都卸了下来……" with disText

# game/chapters/01/ch_01_28.rpy:11
translate chinese ch01_28_Nap_c84c7d07:

    # n "Gradually, your eyelids begin to droop, and the comforting veil of darkness envelopes you in its soothing embrace..."
    n "渐渐地，你的眼皮开始下垂，黑暗的安抚之幕用它舒适的怀抱将你包围……"

